  "description": "Codex++ 插件 - DeepSeek V4 计费面板。实时显示 token 消耗、费用、缓存命中率和账户余额",
  "main": "codex-deepseek-billing.js",
  "scripts": {
    "install": "powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File tools/install.ps1",
